    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「おや？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「おはよう、えっと転校生くん……だっけ？　早起きだね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「いいねいいね、早寝早起きは健康の秘訣だわさ！　にゃはは～☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「ん～？　女の子といっしょの部屋だと寝るに寝れなかった？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「にゃはは、トモが『変なことしないように』って縛りあげたんだっけ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「ごめんね～、気が回らなくて♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「まさかトモが男の子つれてくるとは思わないしさ、そのへん気配りができなかったよ～う？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「トモったら、男の子とか苦手だったのに。きみには気を許してるっぽい、生徒会で色々あったのかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「トモも、ちょっとずつ変わってきてるんだね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「むかしのトモなら、男子と同じ屋根のしたで寝るなんて絶対にありえなかったよ～う。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「確実に寒空のしたに放りだしてたわさ、なのに縛るだけで勘弁してたもんね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「にゃはは。縛るだけでもじゅうぶんキツいか、ごめんね転校生くん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「トモってば、生真面目すぎるんだよね～。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あたしが『ゆるい』ぶん、自分が『しっかり』しなきゃと思うみたいでね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あたしさ、『ぎん』って男の子っぽい名前でしょ。うちの両親は、男の子がほしかったみたい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「代々、男ばっかり生まれる家系だしね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「だからあたし、男の子として育てられたわさ。だからこんなふうに、粗野に育っちゃったの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「女の子の気持ちとか、よくわかんないんだよね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「だもんで、いろいろ気遣いとかできないから。トモには、苦労をかけっぱなし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「申し訳ないと思ってるんだわさ、これでも♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「齢を重ねて、胸もふくらんできて、ちょっとは女の子らしくしなくちゃ～とも思うんだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「なかなか難しいわさ、にゃはは……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「今も、こうして木刀で素振りとかしてるし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「粗野でしょ～、女の子っぽくないわさ？　女の子って朝は何してんのかな～、朝シャン？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「にゃはは。日課なんだわさ、素振り。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「朝に三千、夕に八千、二の太刀いらずの示現流～ってね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「恥ずかしいとこ、見られちゃったかな～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「トモやイチが寝てる間に、こっそり修行してるんだもん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「血のにじむような努力とかしない、天賦の強さ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「そんな感じの、かっこいい部長でありたいんだけどね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「なかなか、難しいわさ。手に血マメをつくって、泥だらけになって、鍛えないと……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「トモたちに追いつかれちゃう！　これでもね、あたしも焦ってるんだよ～う？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「かっこつけたいの、部長だから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「後輩たちにとって手が届かないぐらい強くて遠い、憧れられる存在でいたいんだよ～う♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「できるだけ、長くね。トモたちが、それを望んでくれるかぎりね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あたしは、せめて『お姫さま』みたいにかわいい後輩たちを守れるぐらい、強くありたい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-pajamas",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「『お姫さま』より弱い侍なんて、情けないからね～？　にゃはは☆」"
